<title>KENYA: SOCCER-KENYA AND NIGERIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KENYA AND NIGERIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya and Nigeria drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup African zone, group one qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Kenya - Ken Simiyu 25</p>
<p>Nigeria - Jonathan Akpoborie 48</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
</text>
